== Overview ==
The '''Skeleton Toilet''' is a special [[Enemies|enemy]] that spawned in the Halloween event [[Abysmal Mode]] and [[Endless Mode|Endless Mode.]] It has a lot of health and can bite units to stun them. It was released in the [[Episode 66 Update]].

His stun is different from the normal stun of other [[Enemies]], because instead of a 💤 emoji appearing, a 💀 emoji appears, which causes healer units to not have the ability to heal them.

== Waves ==

=== Abysmal Mode ===
Wave 31: x1

Wave 35: x1

Wave 43: x2

Wave 49: x2

Wave 50: x1

=== Endless Mode ===
Wave 62: x5

== Health ==
1,464,000 Health in Abysmal Mode Wave 50

== Strategy ==
*High DPS units are recommended to defeat this enemy due to its high health.
*Healers are not recommended when this toilet shows up as they cannot heal troops with the 💀 emoji from this toilet.
*Use units with stun blocking to defeat this enemy. Bald Toilet is recommended because he blocks 100 stuns. Unstunnable units are recommended the most.

== Trivia ==

* Fun Fact: This toilet has actually appeared in the actual series, as in [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Skibidi_toilet_69#undefined Episode 69 Part 1] in the series, there were actual skeleton toilets. However, when this update was released, there were no actual skeleton toilets.

